{"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_05F7F0","resource_class":"BRIEFING_NBE","status":"TRANSLATED_PENDING_CSV_MERGE","translations":[{"unique_index":0,"cn_text":"说到法国，国歌也很让人印象深刻。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":48,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":1,"cn_text":"《马赛曲》吧。我知道它也受到过不少批评。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":60,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":2,"cn_text":"毕竟唱的是“公民们，拿起武器，让敌人污秽的鲜血染红田野”。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":87,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":3,"cn_text":"那首歌创作于法国大革命刚结束不久。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":51,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":4,"cn_text":"周边国家害怕革命浪潮威胁君主制，因此不断向法国新生的革命政府施压。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":99,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":5,"cn_text":"为了对抗这些压力、守护立宪政治，志愿兵们唱的歌就是《马赛曲》。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":93,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":6,"cn_text":"没有武力，就保护不了立宪政治。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":45,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":7,"cn_text":"是啊。歌词里确实有些地方过于好战，但也不能忘记，正因为有他们，才有今天民主的法国。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":123,"review_flag":""}]}